WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:21.021 --> 00:23.023
[upbeat music playing]

00:37.579 --> 00:41.708
♪ I was a loner
Who just couldn't be found ♪

00:41.791 --> 00:46.004
♪ I want my life to be ordinary ♪

00:46.087 --> 00:50.258
♪ I was a loner
Who just couldn't be found no more ♪

00:52.260 --> 00:54.429
[panting]

00:54.512 --> 00:58.391
♪ I was a loner
Who just couldn't be found ♪

00:58.475 --> 01:02.729
- ♪ I want my life to be ordinary ♪
- [breathes heavily]

01:02.812 --> 01:08.318
♪ I was a loner
Who just couldn't be found no more ♪

01:08.401 --> 01:09.778
[grunts]

01:22.707 --> 01:23.666
[doorknob rattles]

01:28.129 --> 01:30.715
[upbeat music fades]

01:32.050 --> 01:33.051
[keys rattle]

01:33.551 --> 01:35.637
[birds chirping]

01:40.850 --> 01:42.352
[distant car engine starts]

01:46.314 --> 01:48.399
Jiwoo. Did you hear from your dad?

01:51.820 --> 01:54.489
[Sergeant Cho] Yoon Jiwoo.
Did your dad call you?

01:55.240 --> 01:57.909
Hey, brat. I'm asking you a question.

01:58.910 --> 02:00.411
When are you done today?

02:01.204 --> 02:03.373
If your dad calls, answer.

02:03.456 --> 02:06.042
And call me to tell me if he does.

02:15.552 --> 02:18.429
Hey! Tell him to turn himself in
if he calls!

02:19.597 --> 02:20.598
[Sergeant Cho] Yeah?

02:23.059 --> 02:25.019
- That kid is such a brat.
- [detective] Yup.

02:28.439 --> 02:32.861
YOON JIWOO, JUNKIE, IDIOT
GET LOST, DRUGGIE, PSYCHO BITCH

02:32.944 --> 02:35.321
[upbeat music playing]

02:38.491 --> 02:42.579
♪ I was a loner
Who just couldn't be found ♪

02:42.662 --> 02:45.748
♪ I want my life to be ordinary ♪

02:45.832 --> 02:48.126
[bully 1] Wow, she actually came back.

02:48.209 --> 02:52.130
This outcast…
You're an honor roll student now, huh?

02:52.213 --> 02:53.840
So, you're not moving away?

02:53.923 --> 02:55.383
- Cut it out.
- Druggie, transfer.

02:55.466 --> 02:57.218
You know, her daddy
could have obliterated you.

02:57.302 --> 02:59.804
Oh, that's bullshit.
There are cops everywhere.

02:59.888 --> 03:02.807
Her junkie dad
is probably dead somewhere, huh?

03:02.891 --> 03:05.393
[indistinct chatter]

03:05.476 --> 03:08.271
[students clamoring]

03:10.773 --> 03:12.066
[student 1] I did well that time.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.193
[student 2] Whatever.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.194
[student 1] Hurry up.

03:14.277 --> 03:15.236
Let's try again.

03:15.320 --> 03:17.113
[indistinct chatter]

03:17.822 --> 03:19.449
- Run for it! Sorry!
- My bad!

03:19.532 --> 03:20.742
[student 3] Oh, over here!

03:20.825 --> 03:22.702
[bully 1] Man, she's fucking annoying.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.456
What? You fucker?

03:26.539 --> 03:28.958
- What? What's your problem?
- Hold on.

03:29.042 --> 03:31.252
[bully 1] The damn junkie is annoying.

03:31.336 --> 03:32.545
[sighs]

03:34.005 --> 03:35.840
- [student 4] Oh, shit.
- [student 5] There we go.

03:40.428 --> 03:42.013
[distant phone rings]

03:42.513 --> 03:43.681
[sighs]

03:43.765 --> 03:46.809
Okay, so, the school
is transferring you out.

03:47.393 --> 03:49.479
[teacher] I'll prepare
all the necessary forms, so--

03:49.562 --> 03:50.939
Why should I transfer?

03:52.190 --> 03:55.109
Do you wanna keep
making people uncomfortable, Jiwoo?

03:56.736 --> 03:59.572
Do you know how many calls I got
from disgruntled parents?

04:00.573 --> 04:01.616
[phone vibrates]

04:01.699 --> 04:02.700
[sighs]

04:04.202 --> 04:06.537
[teacher] You still can't get
a hold of your dad?

04:08.122 --> 04:12.502
HAPPY 17TH BIRTHDAY
YOON DONGHOON SENT YOU A CAKE

04:12.585 --> 04:14.379
[students clamor]

04:14.462 --> 04:15.421
[groans]

04:16.881 --> 04:18.258
[student 6] Hey. Give me that.

04:18.341 --> 04:20.343
- Go away.
- [giggles]

04:20.426 --> 04:23.846
- Oh, no. You want it?
- Oh, poor baby, did it hurt?

04:23.930 --> 04:25.807
- [laughs]
- [bully 1] Loser.

04:25.890 --> 04:26.933
So cute.

04:27.016 --> 04:28.309
- What a loser.
- [student 6] Hey.

04:28.393 --> 04:30.186
Give me my phone.

04:32.855 --> 04:33.940
[gasps]
Oh, my god!

04:34.023 --> 04:35.858
Jeez, drugs on her. Call the cops.
[laughs]

04:35.942 --> 04:37.860
- Oh, my god.
- How could you bring drugs to school?

04:37.944 --> 04:40.071
- I'm such a gangster.
- Hey, stop. Back off.

04:41.114 --> 04:44.158
Oh, my. You thought it was okay
to bring drugs here?

04:44.242 --> 04:46.119
- You bitch.
- [laughs]

04:46.202 --> 04:47.328
[bully 1] What?

04:47.412 --> 04:48.538
What, fucker? Oh!

04:48.621 --> 04:50.290
- [bully 2] What's she doing?
- [pained groan]

04:50.373 --> 04:52.458
- Did she lose her mind?
- Are you kidding me?

04:53.209 --> 04:55.920
Shit. Are you insane?

04:56.421 --> 04:59.007
- Are you fucking crazy?
- [bully 2] What's she doing?

04:59.090 --> 05:00.008
You fucking…

05:00.091 --> 05:01.592
- [bully 1 yelps]
- [students shriek]

05:02.176 --> 05:03.720
[yells]

05:03.803 --> 05:05.638
- [bully 1] Oh, shit.
- [bully 2 screaming]

05:05.722 --> 05:06.973
[bully 1] Are you fucking crazy?

05:07.056 --> 05:08.141
[bully 3] You crazy bitch.

05:08.224 --> 05:09.600
[students shriek]

05:09.684 --> 05:11.227
[bully 1] Get over here, you bitch!

05:11.311 --> 05:13.980
- [Jiwoo grunts]
- [bully 1 screams]

05:14.522 --> 05:15.732
Hey!

05:15.815 --> 05:17.984
You crazy bitch. Let her go!
[groans]

05:18.067 --> 05:21.029
[students clamoring]

05:21.112 --> 05:22.739
[students shriek]

05:22.822 --> 05:23.906
[bullies groan]

05:24.949 --> 05:26.617
- [knife rattles]
- [students shriek]

05:27.910 --> 05:30.455
[students screaming]

05:31.664 --> 05:32.707
[loud thud]

05:35.001 --> 05:37.045
[panting]

05:37.128 --> 05:38.296
[indistinct murmuring]

05:38.379 --> 05:40.465
[panting]

05:54.896 --> 05:56.064
Leave me alone!

05:56.147 --> 05:57.231
[groans]

06:00.485 --> 06:02.820
You should expect that
from a gangster's daughter.

06:02.904 --> 06:05.073
[breathing heavily]

06:06.699 --> 06:07.825
[students shriek]

06:07.909 --> 06:10.828
[indistinct chatter]

06:10.912 --> 06:11.746
Yoon Jiwoo!

06:12.330 --> 06:13.373
[sniffles]

06:13.456 --> 06:15.666
[student 7] She's so crazy…

06:15.750 --> 06:17.502
SHIN YOUNG GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL
YOON JIWOO

06:17.585 --> 06:19.087
I'll withdraw.

06:19.170 --> 06:21.672
[students clamoring]

06:24.133 --> 06:26.677
SHIN YOUNG GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

06:26.761 --> 06:29.097
♪ Hey, yeah, yeah, yeah… ♪

06:29.180 --> 06:31.265
[Sergeant Cho] Kim Geonyeong,
that punk did…

06:31.349 --> 06:32.809
- [Jiwoo grunts]
- Hey!

06:32.892 --> 06:35.103
- [detective] Hey, what… Hold on.
- [Sergeant Cho] What the hell that…

06:35.186 --> 06:37.188
Hey! You brat!

06:37.271 --> 06:39.357
- Hey, the hell! What's your problem?
- [panting]

06:39.440 --> 06:41.192
- [Sergeant Cho] Jiwoo. Hey!
- [detective groans]

06:41.275 --> 06:42.235
[Sergeant Cho] Stop right there!

06:42.318 --> 06:43.736
- Hey, damn it!
- [engine starts]

06:45.029 --> 06:48.116
- Hey! Jiwoo! You little…
- Shit.

06:48.199 --> 06:49.117
[upbeat music playing]

06:49.200 --> 06:50.118
[tires screech]

06:50.201 --> 06:52.328
[Sergeant Cho] You're dead
once I catch you.

06:52.412 --> 06:53.371
Hey!

06:53.955 --> 06:55.081
You little…

06:55.164 --> 06:56.541
[tires screech]

06:56.624 --> 06:58.251
[Sergeant Cho] Where are you going?

06:58.334 --> 06:59.502
[tires screech]

07:00.002 --> 07:01.045
Hey!

07:01.587 --> 07:03.673
- Jiwoo!
- ♪ I was a loner ♪

07:03.756 --> 07:06.592
- ♪ Who just couldn't be found ♪
- [panting]

07:06.676 --> 07:09.762
- [train rattling]
- ♪ I want my life to be ordinary ♪

07:10.346 --> 07:15.268
♪ I was a loner
Who just couldn't be found no more ♪

07:16.269 --> 07:18.271
- [waves crashing]
- [upbeat music fades]

07:27.113 --> 07:29.574
[somber music]

07:33.161 --> 07:35.872
PHOTOS

08:01.731 --> 08:03.983
[detective] Hey, Jiwoo,
were you with your dad?

08:04.734 --> 08:06.444
- So?
- [Sergeant Cho] Answer us.

08:07.069 --> 08:08.905
- You brat. Hey!
- [detective] Ah… Come on.

08:08.988 --> 08:10.323
- Are you a thug?
- Come on, man.

08:15.745 --> 08:16.913
[keys jingle]

08:18.164 --> 08:18.998
[lock clicks]

08:21.042 --> 08:21.918
[door slams close]

08:32.386 --> 08:34.805
[cell phone vibrating]

08:47.401 --> 08:49.737
[phone dialing]

08:52.490 --> 08:53.658
[line rings]

08:55.618 --> 08:56.953
[exhales deeply]

09:02.625 --> 09:04.627
[phone dialing]

09:06.754 --> 09:08.339
- [line rings]
- [Donghoon sighs]

09:11.509 --> 09:14.220
[cell phone vibrating]

09:21.978 --> 09:22.812
[sighs]

09:23.771 --> 09:27.233
[Donghoon] Jiwoo, it's Dad.
[chuckles]

09:27.316 --> 09:29.569
Why weren't you answering your phone?

09:30.069 --> 09:34.407
Happy birthday, my dear daughter.
[chuckles]

09:35.283 --> 09:38.077
Sorry, Dad can't even cook you
a birthday dinner.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.036
[sighs]

09:39.120 --> 09:42.039
Did you get the gift I sent you?

09:42.123 --> 09:44.500
The iPad. Yeah.

09:44.584 --> 09:46.043
It's expensive.

09:48.129 --> 09:49.088
Hello?

09:50.298 --> 09:52.216
How was your day, huh?

09:52.758 --> 09:55.469
So did you go singing
with your friends again?

09:57.179 --> 09:58.347
[puffs]

09:58.431 --> 09:59.765
Jiwoo. Jiwoo.

10:00.433 --> 10:01.392
Hello?

10:01.475 --> 10:04.604
The police looking for you,
keep following me around.

10:05.688 --> 10:09.066
They say I'm a gangster's daughter,
so no one talks to me at school.

10:09.150 --> 10:12.153
TOP MOST WANTED FUGITIVES

10:13.738 --> 10:14.947
What you…

10:17.116 --> 10:18.951
What is this about?

10:19.035 --> 10:20.119
Hey, you…

10:21.370 --> 10:23.623
You should have told me about this.

10:23.706 --> 10:24.707
What do you mean?

10:24.790 --> 10:27.126
Your phone's always off.
And you never tell me where you are!

10:28.169 --> 10:30.254
What did you do this time?

10:30.338 --> 10:32.423
Why do you keep doing this?

10:32.506 --> 10:35.509
[scoffs]
That's not it. No, you're wrong.

10:35.593 --> 10:37.011
[Jiwoo sobs]

10:37.094 --> 10:38.054
Jiwoo.

10:40.264 --> 10:43.559
I'll settle everything
and come back to you, okay?

10:43.643 --> 10:44.602
[sobs]

10:44.685 --> 10:46.354
[somber music playing]

10:46.437 --> 10:48.564
So please just wait.

10:51.984 --> 10:53.527
I won't wait anymore.

10:56.489 --> 10:58.658
Don't come back, you're dead to me now.

11:01.994 --> 11:04.455
[busy signal beeping]

11:08.626 --> 11:09.752
[thuds]

11:22.306 --> 11:23.265
[Donghoon sighs]

11:26.018 --> 11:27.645
[engine starts]

11:33.025 --> 11:34.694
[Taeju] Hey. What are you doing?

11:34.777 --> 11:36.404
[cell phone chimes]

11:38.197 --> 11:39.281
[sighs]

11:43.160 --> 11:45.413
DO YOU KNOW WHAT I'M GOING THROUGH
BECAUSE OF YOU?

11:45.496 --> 11:48.040
HAVE YOU FORGOTTEN ABOUT ME?
AM I NOT YOUR DAUGHTER?

11:48.124 --> 11:51.377
THE COPS ARE STILL OUTSIDE THE HOUSE
EVERYONE IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD KNOWS

11:51.460 --> 11:53.212
DAD, WHERE ARE YOU…
PLEASE CALL ME

11:58.509 --> 12:00.386
- Taeju.
- Yes?

12:03.097 --> 12:04.098
[sighs]

12:05.057 --> 12:06.058
Get out of here.

12:09.311 --> 12:12.773
[engine revving]

12:51.604 --> 12:52.855
[sucks teeth]

12:52.938 --> 12:54.190
[grunts]

12:54.690 --> 12:55.983
- Hey.
- [plastic crinkles]

12:57.067 --> 12:59.195
- Hey. Hey, hey, hey.
- Hmm.

12:59.278 --> 13:00.488
[detective] What the heck.

13:00.571 --> 13:02.823
[Sergeant Cho] Yo,
cut back on your smoking.

13:02.907 --> 13:05.159
Shit. I'm about to explode.

13:05.242 --> 13:06.786
- [groans]
- [thuds]

13:08.829 --> 13:10.998
[Sergeant Cho] Shit.
You asshole. No. Damn it.

13:11.081 --> 13:12.583
- [groans]
- [glass shatters]

13:33.187 --> 13:35.773
[keys rattling]

13:36.941 --> 13:38.692
[Donghoon] Jiwoo. It's Dad.

13:38.776 --> 13:40.611
[lock clicks]

13:42.071 --> 13:44.365
[door rattling]

13:49.328 --> 13:50.871
[doorbell rings]

13:50.955 --> 13:54.083
[footsteps thudding]

14:01.006 --> 14:02.800
[rattling]

14:09.890 --> 14:11.642
[suspenseful music]

14:14.144 --> 14:15.062
[Jiwoo] Dad?

14:21.902 --> 14:23.404
[door rattles]

14:23.487 --> 14:24.446
[gunshot]

14:29.535 --> 14:30.411
[Donghoon groans]

14:32.705 --> 14:33.664
[thuds]

14:33.747 --> 14:35.416
[Donghoon groans]

14:37.334 --> 14:38.168
[groaning continues]

14:38.794 --> 14:39.920
Papa.

14:40.004 --> 14:41.422
Dad. Are you okay?

14:41.505 --> 14:43.716
- What's wrong, huh?
- [Donghoon] Please…

14:44.300 --> 14:45.676
Not my girl.

14:47.386 --> 14:48.554
[Donghoon groaning]

14:49.597 --> 14:50.931
- Papa!
- [gunshot]

14:51.015 --> 14:52.391
- [Donghoon groans]
- [gasps]

14:54.226 --> 14:55.936
[Donghoon grunts]

14:57.855 --> 14:59.940
- [Jiwoo] Papa!
- [banging on door]

15:00.024 --> 15:01.442
Open up the door, Papa!

15:01.525 --> 15:03.569
[Donghoon] Oh, dear.
Don't come out, Jiwoo!

15:03.652 --> 15:05.029
Don't come out!

15:05.988 --> 15:08.407
[Donghoon groaning]

15:09.116 --> 15:10.701
[thuds]

15:11.452 --> 15:12.828
[groans]

15:14.997 --> 15:15.915
[door lock clicks]

15:18.334 --> 15:20.586
Papa, are you okay? Open the door.

15:20.669 --> 15:21.712
Please, Papa.

15:21.795 --> 15:23.881
- [Jiwoo] I wanna come to you.
- [breathes heavily]

15:23.964 --> 15:25.758
Please let me out.

15:25.841 --> 15:27.301
[sobs]
Please.

15:27.384 --> 15:28.969
[groans]

15:29.053 --> 15:29.929
[Donghoon] Jiwoo.

15:30.012 --> 15:31.805
Huh? Uh… Yeah.

15:33.057 --> 15:34.141
[Donghoon] I'm sorry.

15:34.224 --> 15:37.186
[panting]
I made your life so hard.

15:37.269 --> 15:38.437
[sobs]

15:38.520 --> 15:40.856
No! No, it's okay!

15:40.940 --> 15:43.442
It's okay! Please, open the door.

15:43.525 --> 15:46.236
No, Papa. Open it!
[cries]

15:46.320 --> 15:48.405
[Donghoon] Why did I end up like this?
[grunts]

15:50.032 --> 15:51.700
This is all my fault.

15:51.784 --> 15:52.993
No. It…

15:53.744 --> 15:55.496
[sobs]
It's not, Papa,

15:55.579 --> 15:56.872
it's not your fault.

15:56.956 --> 15:57.957
Jiwoo.

15:58.958 --> 16:01.043
- Yes, Dad.
- [Donghoon] My dear Jiwoo.

16:03.587 --> 16:04.838
To me…

16:07.508 --> 16:08.884
you were…

16:15.432 --> 16:16.600
[groans weakly]

16:21.855 --> 16:24.316
[shuddered breathing]

16:24.400 --> 16:25.609
I'm coming.

16:26.527 --> 16:29.279
Hold on, Papa. No, just wait.

16:29.863 --> 16:31.865
[grunts]
No, please!

16:31.949 --> 16:34.952
[Jiwoo sobbing]

16:36.328 --> 16:39.456
Papa! No, Papa. Papa!

16:39.540 --> 16:41.417
[crying hysterically]

16:41.500 --> 16:44.169
Papa!
[crying]

16:44.670 --> 16:46.797
[Jiwoo whimpering]

16:48.007 --> 16:49.508
- Oh, no!
- [knife thuds]

16:51.218 --> 16:54.763
[crying continues]

16:57.433 --> 16:59.393
Papa. Papa!

17:00.019 --> 17:01.645
Papa. Wake up.

17:02.187 --> 17:03.981
Please, wake up!

17:04.857 --> 17:09.570
Papa. Please. Please. Papa. Papa. Please.

17:09.653 --> 17:11.447
[shouts]
Help! Someone help!

17:11.530 --> 17:12.614
Someone help!

17:12.698 --> 17:14.950
[muffled]
Somebody, please help my dad!

17:15.034 --> 17:17.036
Someone. Please, someone…

17:17.119 --> 17:20.122
[somber music]

17:38.307 --> 17:39.725
[sobbing]

18:12.091 --> 18:12.925
[lighter clinks open]

18:16.178 --> 18:17.096
[lighter clinks close]

18:42.037 --> 18:44.081
Are you the leader of the operation?

18:48.001 --> 18:49.837
What did you make my dad do?

18:53.799 --> 18:55.175
Beat people?

18:58.887 --> 19:00.889
Did he threaten and stab them?

19:08.605 --> 19:10.315
Who was it that killed my dad?

19:13.527 --> 19:14.653
Your father…

19:17.239 --> 19:19.741
was my most trusted friend and brother.

19:22.911 --> 19:24.204
And Donghoon…

19:27.583 --> 19:29.001
was a good father.

19:33.797 --> 19:35.090
Remember that.

19:45.517 --> 19:47.686
[mortician] Here. Please, come closer.

19:49.563 --> 19:51.106
Come closer.

19:52.024 --> 19:54.193
This will be the last time
you're able to see him,

19:54.276 --> 19:58.238
so say goodbye
and wish him peace in the afterlife.

19:58.322 --> 20:00.574
Feel free to hold his hand
and send him off.

20:27.017 --> 20:29.645
♪ Every smile ♪

20:29.728 --> 20:31.939
- ♪ Every pain… ♪
- [Donghoon] What a nice song.

20:32.522 --> 20:33.941
What's it called?

20:34.024 --> 20:35.609
[Jiwoo] What's wrong with your hand?

20:37.694 --> 20:39.446
[Donghoon] It's because I'm a coward.

20:39.529 --> 20:42.866
[calm music]

20:42.950 --> 20:44.243
[Jiwoo] Papa.

20:44.326 --> 20:45.786
- Hey, you stop.
- [Jiwoo] Why should I?

20:45.869 --> 20:47.412
Don't be a coward.

20:47.496 --> 20:49.581
[Jiwoo] Okay. Papa.

20:50.832 --> 20:51.792
What?

20:52.334 --> 20:56.088
[Jiwoo] If you have the super power
to be able to turn back time…

20:56.171 --> 20:58.382
- [chuckles]
- [Jiwoo] So, if you could…

20:58.465 --> 21:00.175
- Go back?
- [Jiwoo] Yes.

21:00.259 --> 21:03.178
If you could go back to when you were 17…

21:06.348 --> 21:07.683
would you do it?

21:08.225 --> 21:10.477
[calm music continues]

21:12.896 --> 21:13.855
No.

21:16.483 --> 21:17.651
Because, well…

21:18.610 --> 21:20.070
I couldn't be your papa.

21:20.153 --> 21:22.281
- [chuckles]
- Oh, come on.

21:23.782 --> 21:25.200
- [Donghoon] Jiwoo.
- [grunts]

21:25.284 --> 21:28.370
Should we build a house
and live by the sea, huh?

21:28.453 --> 21:30.080
Let's move to Jeju.

21:30.163 --> 21:31.123
No.

21:31.206 --> 21:33.625
We can build a house on the beach,

21:33.709 --> 21:36.336
hang a hammock in the yard,
and have a dog too.

21:36.420 --> 21:37.504
Perfect!

21:37.587 --> 21:39.673
All right. Let's go.

21:39.756 --> 21:41.049
Okay. Hold on, hold on.

21:41.133 --> 21:42.342
When are we going to move?

21:42.426 --> 21:43.302
Soon.

21:45.137 --> 21:46.972
I'm almost done with my job.

21:48.974 --> 21:52.269
♪ A heartbreaking sense
We're drifting slowly away ♪

21:52.352 --> 21:54.313
[Donghoon] Ah, this is nice.

21:54.396 --> 21:57.024
♪ Losing sight of love now ♪

21:57.107 --> 22:02.154
♪ What went wrong? ♪

22:03.572 --> 22:08.577
♪ Lay my head down and rest my mind ♪

22:08.660 --> 22:13.206
♪ Give up searching 'cause I cannot find ♪

22:13.290 --> 22:15.751
♪ The strength I need ♪

22:15.834 --> 22:20.922
♪ To keep on holding on ♪

22:24.718 --> 22:27.054
- [Sergeant Cho] What is it now?
- [Jiwoo] What's your problem?

22:28.263 --> 22:29.890
- You drop the case?
- [Sergeant Cho] Yeah.

22:29.973 --> 22:32.351
There's no murder weapon or a witness.

22:32.434 --> 22:34.394
We have nothing to go off of.

22:34.478 --> 22:35.896
So that's it then?

22:36.438 --> 22:37.773
[sighs]

22:39.524 --> 22:40.484
[paper rustles]

22:41.109 --> 22:42.319
[Jiwoo] What about this asshole?

22:42.903 --> 22:44.237
[shouts]
You have to catch him!

22:44.321 --> 22:46.490
Hey. How can we catch him with this?

22:46.573 --> 22:48.325
You go and catch him then.

22:48.408 --> 22:51.078
Oh, come on, asshole!
A person has been murdered!

22:52.204 --> 22:53.663
Please, stop.

22:56.083 --> 22:57.626
What did you say to your dad?

22:58.460 --> 23:00.170
You're the one who spoke to him last.

23:04.091 --> 23:06.051
He was on the most wanted list

23:06.134 --> 23:08.095
and had been in hiding for three months.

23:08.178 --> 23:09.054
TOP MOST WANTED FUGITIVES

23:09.137 --> 23:11.306
What did you say to make him come home?

23:13.683 --> 23:15.394
I won't wait anymore.

23:18.271 --> 23:20.524
Don't come back, you're dead to me now.

23:23.318 --> 23:25.070
[Sergeant Cho]
He should have turned himself in.

23:25.153 --> 23:27.114
Then he wouldn't have died pointlessly.

23:27.948 --> 23:30.283
[indistinct chatter]

23:30.367 --> 23:31.535
[agent 1] Keep it down.

23:31.618 --> 23:32.619
[man] You assholes!

23:32.702 --> 23:33.829
[agent 2] Stop it!

23:33.912 --> 23:36.164
- Stop. Stop it. Stop.
- [people clamoring]

23:36.248 --> 23:39.334
[agent 3] Hey! Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Hey, hey, stop! Hey, hey, hey!

23:39.418 --> 23:40.794
- [knocks on door]
- [door opens]

23:41.503 --> 23:43.505
[approaching footsteps]

23:48.969 --> 23:50.554
You need to take a look at this.

23:54.015 --> 23:55.183
[chimes]

24:18.039 --> 24:19.040
[elevator bell dings]

24:19.124 --> 24:20.917
[elevator door opens]

24:37.017 --> 24:40.312
[machines whirring]

25:18.558 --> 25:20.936
[paper rustling]

25:23.897 --> 25:25.524
CCTV INVESTIGATION

25:26.233 --> 25:28.360
Please help me find my dad's killer.

25:31.238 --> 25:33.949
You said he was your trusted friend
and brother.

25:35.283 --> 25:36.535
If I find him?

25:38.078 --> 25:39.579
Then I will kill him.

25:45.544 --> 25:46.962
You'll kill him…

25:56.638 --> 25:58.848
Do you know what it is like
to kill someone?

26:14.281 --> 26:15.282
Stab me.

26:19.494 --> 26:22.163
Pretend that I'm the killer and stab me.

26:24.416 --> 26:25.542
[gasps]

26:25.625 --> 26:27.294
- Do it.
- [whimpers]

26:28.211 --> 26:29.045
Do it.

26:31.423 --> 26:33.008
- Do it!
- [yelps]

26:33.091 --> 26:35.051
[whimpering]

26:35.135 --> 26:36.636
[Jiwoo sobs]

26:42.559 --> 26:44.185
- [slaps]
- [Jiwoo groans]

26:45.562 --> 26:46.646
[Jiwoo grunts]

26:48.607 --> 26:50.692
[Jiwoo breathes heavily]

26:53.903 --> 26:55.113
[Mujin] Drag her out.

26:55.614 --> 26:58.199
[Jiwoo whimpering]

27:03.413 --> 27:04.581
[cries]

27:10.295 --> 27:11.713
[Jiwoo sobbing]

27:15.008 --> 27:17.260
[solemn music]

27:23.058 --> 27:27.520
[rain pattering]

27:35.612 --> 27:38.907
[doorbell dings]

27:39.741 --> 27:40.825
[banging on door]

27:44.245 --> 27:47.207
[doorbell dings]

27:54.756 --> 27:56.508
[banging on door]

28:01.846 --> 28:03.431
[banging continues]

28:11.022 --> 28:13.733
[ominous music]

28:22.617 --> 28:24.327
[banging continues]

28:26.204 --> 28:28.623
[doorbell dings]

28:42.804 --> 28:45.724
[breathing heavily]

29:07.412 --> 29:08.580
[sobs]

29:15.336 --> 29:17.005
[engine revs]

29:23.970 --> 29:25.972
[panting]

29:32.228 --> 29:33.313
LOOKING FOR WITNESSES

29:33.980 --> 29:36.274
[upbeat music]

29:42.739 --> 29:45.325
[distant clamoring]

30:03.218 --> 30:05.220
[upbeat music continues]

30:12.644 --> 30:15.480
Oh. Want some drugs? Hey.

30:16.105 --> 30:17.357
[dealer] I'll help you out.

30:19.526 --> 30:21.861
[indistinct chatter]

30:33.414 --> 30:36.084
LOOKING FOR WITNESSES
REWARD: 5 MILLION WON

30:41.005 --> 30:42.340
[car horn honks]

30:47.929 --> 30:49.931
[upbeat music continues]

30:56.312 --> 31:00.525
[old lady] You always pay so much
for cigarettes. Thank you.

31:06.656 --> 31:09.659
LOOKING FOR WITNESSES
REWARD: 5 MILLION WON

31:11.995 --> 31:14.122
[upbeat music]

31:22.922 --> 31:25.800
[cell phone vibrating]

31:29.137 --> 31:32.265
UNKNOWN NUMBER

31:34.392 --> 31:36.102
[punk 1] I know this asshole.

31:36.185 --> 31:37.604
Bring in the money.

31:37.687 --> 31:39.314
I'll text you the location.

31:44.193 --> 31:45.403
[cell phone vibrates]

31:49.782 --> 31:50.909
[drawer scrapes]

31:50.992 --> 31:53.119
[plastic crinkling]

32:08.092 --> 32:10.094
[door opens, closes]

32:10.803 --> 32:12.263
[drug addict coughs]

32:18.144 --> 32:20.813
[distant thudding]

32:25.360 --> 32:26.361
Hey!

32:28.947 --> 32:30.323
You came on time.

32:30.406 --> 32:31.574
Who is that guy?

32:31.658 --> 32:34.327
Show me the money and I'll talk.

32:34.410 --> 32:36.120
Give us the cash first.

32:39.832 --> 32:40.833
[grunts]

32:42.043 --> 32:43.294
[chuckles]

32:49.425 --> 32:50.802
So, who is he?

32:50.885 --> 32:53.513
[cackles]

32:53.596 --> 32:55.556
[punk 2 laughs]

32:56.516 --> 32:59.644
That asshole… his initials are G.R.

33:00.728 --> 33:04.357
The Grim Reaper.

33:05.316 --> 33:07.694
[punk 3] He's like the grim reaper
here to kill you.

33:08.277 --> 33:09.404
Hey!
[laughs]

33:09.487 --> 33:11.614
- Move!
- [laughter]

33:11.698 --> 33:13.533
- Hey, it's really five million won.
- Shit.

33:13.616 --> 33:14.659
- Hey.
- Whoa.

33:14.742 --> 33:17.453
We kill people for one million won.

33:17.537 --> 33:21.207
For five million, we can stuff you
and preserve certain body parts.

33:21.290 --> 33:23.292
- Oh, wow!
- Damn!

33:23.376 --> 33:24.293
Do you like that?

33:24.377 --> 33:25.920
- [loud thwack]
- [punks groaning]

33:26.004 --> 33:27.755
- You're not going anywhere!
- [Jiwoo grunts]

33:28.715 --> 33:31.134
- [Jiwoo groans]
- [laughter]

33:31.676 --> 33:33.136
[punk 1] Kill him! Fuck!

33:33.219 --> 33:34.762
- [Jiwoo groans]
- [punk 1] Step aside.

33:34.846 --> 33:36.472
[punk 2 grunting]

33:37.056 --> 33:38.433
- [Jiwoo grunts]
- [punk 1 growls]

33:38.516 --> 33:40.143
[Jiwoo groans]

33:41.602 --> 33:42.520
[continues groaning]

33:43.062 --> 33:44.856
[punk 1] What, she's a girl.

33:44.939 --> 33:46.357
- [punk 2] Shit.
- [punk 1] Wow, look!

33:46.941 --> 33:48.067
She's pretty.

33:48.151 --> 33:49.944
- Whoa.
- [laughter]

33:50.028 --> 33:52.321
- Hey!
- [grunts]

33:52.405 --> 33:53.865
- [punk 3] Shit!
- [groans]

33:53.948 --> 33:55.908
[Jiwoo grunting]

33:55.992 --> 33:57.076
[punk 3 yells]

33:57.160 --> 33:58.661
[punk 1] Kill her! Damn it!

33:58.745 --> 34:01.873
[punks grunting]

34:01.956 --> 34:02.832
- [punk 1] Bitch!
- Wait.

34:02.915 --> 34:04.250
- [punk 1] Hey!
- [groans]

34:04.333 --> 34:06.044
Don't kick her in the face.

34:06.919 --> 34:08.379
- [grunts]
- [groans]

34:11.507 --> 34:14.218
[car engine rumbling]

34:22.101 --> 34:23.186
[coughs]

34:25.605 --> 34:26.606
[groans]

34:29.317 --> 34:30.318
[grunts]

34:35.907 --> 34:38.284
- [punk 2] Hey!
- [punk 1] Whoa, whoa, whoa. Whoa.

34:38.367 --> 34:39.827
- [tires screech]
- [loud bang]

34:39.911 --> 34:42.163
[punk 3] For god's sake.
Don't you know how to drive?

34:42.246 --> 34:43.414
- [punk 2] Hey, hey, hey.
- [punk 3] Uh, shit.

34:43.498 --> 34:45.041
[punk 1] Hey, pretend you're hurt.

34:46.084 --> 34:48.211
- [punk 3] Fucking dude. Bastard.
- [punk 1] Shut up.

34:49.629 --> 34:51.089
- Yo!
- [panting]

34:51.172 --> 34:53.966
[punk 1] Shit driver!
Threatened for a fight?

34:54.592 --> 34:55.551
- Fuck!
- [groans]

34:56.052 --> 34:56.969
[grunts, pants]

34:57.053 --> 34:58.513
[punk 3] What'd you hit me for?

34:58.596 --> 34:59.889
[punk 1] Asshole!
[groans]

35:01.265 --> 35:03.601
[punk 2] What are you doing, dumbass?
[groans]

35:03.684 --> 35:04.685
[punk 1] Fuck!

35:04.769 --> 35:07.063
[punks groaning]

35:09.315 --> 35:11.734
[punks continue groaning]

35:12.360 --> 35:14.737
[indistinct chatter]

35:14.821 --> 35:16.405
- [grunts, gasps]
- [trunk opens]

35:17.323 --> 35:19.325
[grunting, growling]

35:19.408 --> 35:21.369
[frantic breathing]

35:21.452 --> 35:23.204
[panting]

35:28.668 --> 35:30.711
[breathing heavily]

35:34.006 --> 35:36.759
[panting continues]

35:39.303 --> 35:40.513
[exhales deeply]

35:41.389 --> 35:43.474
[punk 1 groaning]

35:43.558 --> 35:45.101
[punk 3 panting]

35:58.656 --> 36:01.325
[puffing]

36:03.369 --> 36:06.330
[Mujin] If you wanna die,
there are better ways to do it.

36:11.711 --> 36:13.921
It's none of your business, mister.

36:22.889 --> 36:25.057
So? Did you catch my dad's killer?

36:26.684 --> 36:28.394
[puffs]

36:29.353 --> 36:30.354
I guess not.

36:31.439 --> 36:33.274
Stop acting out and stay low

36:33.900 --> 36:35.610
or you'll die on the street.

36:38.988 --> 36:40.531
How can I stay low?

36:42.867 --> 36:45.870
The cops won't investigate,
and you won't do anything!

36:46.829 --> 36:48.080
So how…

36:50.333 --> 36:52.835
How can I live like nothing's wronged?

36:54.378 --> 36:55.254
[sobs]

37:00.134 --> 37:02.178
When all of this is my fault.

37:03.346 --> 37:05.514
[somber music]

37:12.980 --> 37:15.441
[Mujin] Do you have to get revenge?

37:17.526 --> 37:19.403
Regardless of the price you pay?

37:27.036 --> 37:28.663
I will handle all of it.

37:29.872 --> 37:31.123
[puffs]

37:37.004 --> 37:39.799
[Mujin] If you're determined
to catch and kill this man…

37:43.469 --> 37:46.013
you need to be capable of killing someone.

37:56.440 --> 37:59.026
[action music]

38:13.082 --> 38:15.167
[action music continues]

38:25.469 --> 38:28.472
SEONJIN SHIPPING

38:41.902 --> 38:44.155
[gangsters grunting]

38:45.156 --> 38:46.115
[gangster 1] Sir.

38:46.198 --> 38:47.283
[gangster 2] Sir.

38:53.289 --> 38:54.540
[Gangjae] Hello, sir.

38:57.460 --> 38:58.336
Hello, sir.

39:01.422 --> 39:02.256
Our new member.

39:03.841 --> 39:05.051
[Mujin] Say hello.

39:15.895 --> 39:18.773
[grunting]

39:18.856 --> 39:20.274
Who the hell is she?

39:21.650 --> 39:22.485
[Cheol-Ho scoffs]

39:22.568 --> 39:23.903
[Cheol-Ho] Maybe she's a snack?

39:24.528 --> 39:26.364
For us to eat when we're bored?
[chuckles]

39:26.447 --> 39:28.157
[gangster minor] Hey. She's a little girl.

39:28.240 --> 39:30.910
[Cheol-Ho] Exactly. So we'll
raise her well, then we'll eat her.

39:31.619 --> 39:34.163
[Gangjae] He said she's a new member,
not a snack.

39:34.246 --> 39:35.498
[Cheol-Ho] Okay, asshole.

39:36.540 --> 39:38.084
[indistinct chatter]

39:38.626 --> 39:41.045
[Cheol-Ho] Crazy bastard.
[chuckles]

39:41.128 --> 39:42.088
Hey, kid.

39:43.047 --> 39:44.131
[chuckles]

39:44.840 --> 39:45.966
Come along.

39:50.262 --> 39:51.305
[gangster 3] Hey!

39:56.185 --> 39:58.521
[birds chirping]

40:03.025 --> 40:04.110
[Taeju] Tell me…

40:05.194 --> 40:06.821
What do you plan to do with her?

40:09.532 --> 40:11.075
She wants to get revenge.

40:15.913 --> 40:16.956
Let her.

40:25.172 --> 40:26.799
[Gangjae] You can sleep here.

40:29.009 --> 40:29.969
[Gangjae chuckles]

40:34.432 --> 40:37.476
From now on, cleaning, laundry,
and the dishes

40:37.560 --> 40:38.853
are your job, okay?

40:40.396 --> 40:41.939
Finally, get to live upstairs.

40:42.606 --> 40:43.983
I was the youngest until you.

40:45.776 --> 40:46.819
Two years.

40:49.488 --> 40:50.739
[Gangjae sighs]

40:51.657 --> 40:54.910
Once you prove yourself,
you can move up there.

40:55.828 --> 40:58.164
You really become part
of the organization.

40:59.707 --> 41:01.125
I'm going up there.

41:01.208 --> 41:02.877
I'll make it to the top.

41:07.715 --> 41:08.757
[exhales deeply]

41:11.552 --> 41:12.803
Why are you here?

41:13.971 --> 41:14.847
You're a girl.

41:15.639 --> 41:17.016
To get stronger.

41:21.770 --> 41:23.105
[scoffs]

41:23.189 --> 41:24.190
Right.

41:26.192 --> 41:27.193
I wish you luck.

41:30.070 --> 41:32.448
[door opens, closes]

41:44.502 --> 41:48.255
DECEASED, YOON DONGHOON

41:51.759 --> 41:53.052
Don't worry.

41:58.349 --> 41:59.683
I'll be fine.

42:01.936 --> 42:03.562
[gangsters exercising noisily]

42:03.646 --> 42:06.023
[loud clattering]

42:23.290 --> 42:24.917
[gangster 4] Come on. Let's go, let's go!

42:27.711 --> 42:31.590
[indistinct loud chatter]

42:33.133 --> 42:35.261
[Cheol-Ho] Hey, newbie!

42:36.637 --> 42:38.138
Hey!

42:39.390 --> 42:43.519
- Whoa!
- ♪ Oh, you're sexy, sexy ♪

42:43.602 --> 42:45.896
♪ Sexy, sexy, sexy, sexy! ♪

42:45.980 --> 42:46.855
[gangsters] Yeah! Yeah!

42:46.939 --> 42:49.608
[Cheol-Ho] ♪ Sexy, sexy, sexy, sexy! ♪

42:49.692 --> 42:51.610
♪ You're so sexy! ♪

42:51.694 --> 42:52.903
[laughter]

42:52.987 --> 42:55.030
What's that look for, you fucking bitch?

42:55.114 --> 42:56.240
[laughter]

42:56.740 --> 42:58.492
[Cheol-Ho] Come on, give me some ass.

42:58.576 --> 43:00.202
[gangsters cheering]

43:00.286 --> 43:01.161
[gangster 5] Yeah!

43:01.245 --> 43:03.205
[Cheol-Ho]
Hey. You're the prettiest one here.

43:03.289 --> 43:04.707
[laughter]

43:04.790 --> 43:06.792
[gangster 5] You're absolutely
the fucking prettiest!

43:06.875 --> 43:08.335
[Cheol-Ho] A man is declaring
his love for you--

43:08.419 --> 43:09.420
You…

43:09.503 --> 43:12.172
[gangsters exclaiming]

43:12.256 --> 43:13.382
Fuck your clothes.

43:13.465 --> 43:17.553
[gangsters cheering]

43:23.892 --> 43:26.186
[gangsters exercising noisily]

43:48.500 --> 43:51.462
- Well, that's annoying.
- [Jiwoo grunts]

43:52.129 --> 43:53.088
- [groans]
- [Cheol-Ho exclaims]

43:53.172 --> 43:54.089
Are you okay?

43:54.173 --> 43:55.215
Damn!

43:56.008 --> 43:57.426
Oh, how cute.

43:57.509 --> 43:58.594
A cup?

43:59.762 --> 44:01.805
Oh, look at the fire in your eyes.

44:01.889 --> 44:04.308
You wanna fight, huh? Let's go.

44:04.391 --> 44:05.684
- [Jiwoo] Fucker!
- [groans]

44:06.852 --> 44:08.479
- You fucking bitch.
- [grunts]

44:08.562 --> 44:10.856
Oh, shit!
[laughs]

44:10.939 --> 44:13.233
- Give me some ass.
- [grunts]

44:13.317 --> 44:14.401
[Jiwoo groans]

44:14.485 --> 44:15.819
Fucking bitch.

44:15.903 --> 44:17.821
- [gangster minor] Hey. Stop it.
- [Cheol-Ho] Hey!

44:17.905 --> 44:20.824
If you're not gonna give us ass,
why are you here, you bitch?

44:20.908 --> 44:23.577
Hey, hey, that bitch hit me first.
Let go of me!

44:23.661 --> 44:24.828
Get off!

44:24.912 --> 44:27.122
[panting]

44:49.687 --> 44:52.064
[grunting]

44:57.778 --> 45:00.197
[panting]

45:02.491 --> 45:03.450
[grunts]

45:03.534 --> 45:05.536
[breathing heavily]

45:08.747 --> 45:10.749
[panting]

45:12.042 --> 45:13.585
You gonna run away?

45:14.920 --> 45:16.296
No, I'm going to win.

45:16.380 --> 45:17.589
[breathes deeply]

45:20.175 --> 45:21.343
Exactly.

45:23.470 --> 45:24.847
You can't win like that.

45:30.269 --> 45:31.645
It's not "winning"…

45:33.772 --> 45:34.898
but "killing".

45:36.942 --> 45:38.152
"I'll kill him."

45:41.238 --> 45:42.990
That's how you need to fight.

45:44.408 --> 45:46.201
Don't compete with strength.

45:46.285 --> 45:48.704
Regardless of training, you'll lose.

45:48.787 --> 45:50.038
And what do I do?

45:50.122 --> 45:51.582
[pants]

45:56.795 --> 45:58.130
Attack the vitals.

45:59.381 --> 46:00.424
[knife thuds]

46:01.925 --> 46:06.513
The temple, upper lip, chin, solar plexus,

46:07.181 --> 46:09.308
and genitals.

46:13.854 --> 46:15.606
If you hit only the vitals…

46:17.191 --> 46:19.318
- then you can take down your opponent.
- [Jiwoo exhales]

46:20.152 --> 46:22.362
[breathes deeply]

46:23.822 --> 46:24.740
Okay.

46:26.074 --> 46:27.034
Let's try it.

46:27.117 --> 46:29.495
[pants]
Huh?

46:30.204 --> 46:31.121
Come here.

46:31.622 --> 46:34.541
[upbeat music]

46:39.922 --> 46:41.173
[breathes deeply]

46:45.302 --> 46:48.305
[panting]

46:48.388 --> 46:50.265
[grunting]

46:56.855 --> 46:57.731
[groans]

47:02.903 --> 47:05.239
[panting]

47:06.865 --> 47:07.825
[yelps]

47:08.492 --> 47:09.493
Upper lip.

47:12.955 --> 47:14.665
[grunting]

47:14.748 --> 47:15.791
Harder!

47:15.874 --> 47:16.917
Chin.

47:18.627 --> 47:19.670
Then guard.

47:21.630 --> 47:22.798
- [body thuds]
- [grunts]

47:26.260 --> 47:27.344
[breathes sharply]

47:29.096 --> 47:31.557
[both grunting]

47:35.227 --> 47:36.436
[grunts]

47:37.020 --> 47:38.647
[gasps]
Are you okay?

47:39.648 --> 47:40.983
That was a good hit.

47:41.817 --> 47:44.611
You've got talent, but not enough power.

47:45.195 --> 47:46.196
Again.

47:46.280 --> 47:48.574
[Jiwoo panting]

47:50.742 --> 47:52.744
[Mujin and Jiwoo grunting]

47:57.708 --> 47:59.167
[lighter clinks, clicks]

48:01.420 --> 48:02.462
[lighter clinks close]

48:09.344 --> 48:10.470
[puffs]

48:28.196 --> 48:30.782
[lively music]

48:37.205 --> 48:38.373
[grunting]

48:45.422 --> 48:46.465
[pants]

49:03.231 --> 49:04.358
[grunts]

49:06.860 --> 49:08.654
[panting]

49:08.737 --> 49:10.197
[grunts]

49:15.994 --> 49:16.870
DO NOT ENTER

49:16.954 --> 49:17.788
SEONJIN SHIPPING

49:17.871 --> 49:19.873
[gangsters] We protect the organization!

49:20.999 --> 49:23.627
The organization protects us all.

49:23.710 --> 49:26.004
[gangsters] Dongcheon! Dongcheon!

49:26.088 --> 49:29.549
[gangsters cheering]

49:32.552 --> 49:34.846
[cheering continues]

49:36.306 --> 49:38.392
[screaming]

49:44.064 --> 49:44.940
[groans]

49:50.988 --> 49:52.823
[grunting]

49:56.702 --> 49:58.620
[groans in pain]

50:02.040 --> 50:03.125
[groans]

50:03.792 --> 50:06.545
[grumbling]

50:06.628 --> 50:08.672
[gangsters cheering]

50:08.755 --> 50:10.132
[yells]

50:13.468 --> 50:14.469
[both groan]

50:18.265 --> 50:19.975
[gangsters cheering]

50:25.814 --> 50:27.941
[grunting]

50:48.086 --> 50:51.256
[gangsters cheering]

50:54.092 --> 50:55.260
[Taeju] Gangjae wins!

50:56.261 --> 50:59.973
And your reward, a week off
and ten million won.

51:00.474 --> 51:02.184
[gangsters cheering]

51:02.267 --> 51:03.101
[lighter clinks]

51:07.022 --> 51:09.191
[gangsters] Do Gangjae! Do Gangjae!

51:09.274 --> 51:11.276
- Rookie's still standing though.
- [lighter clinks]

51:11.359 --> 51:12.444
[grunts]

51:13.195 --> 51:15.739
[gangsters cheering]

51:24.331 --> 51:27.459
[breathing heavily]

51:27.542 --> 51:30.045
[uplifting music]

51:34.591 --> 51:37.511
[panting]

51:40.305 --> 51:42.307
[panting continues]

51:42.390 --> 51:43.391
[yells]

51:43.475 --> 51:45.477
[closing theme music]
